# What the isolated Colab environment needs on top of ComfyUI's own requirements.txt (lock.sh adds that
# one, without its torch lines). Regenerate requirements.lock with ./lock.sh after any change here.
#
# The torch family is pinned to the build the studio was verified with. Keep it in sync with
# TORCH_VERSION in runtime_setup.sh and with the wheels archive (sageattention is compiled against it).
torch==2.11.0
torchvision==0.26.0
torchaudio==2.11.0
torchcodec==0.11.0
# Declared dependencies of the audio packages in audio_requirements.txt (those are installed with
# --no-deps, so everything they need must be listed here). Colab's image used to provide these.
